WEBVTT

00:01:58.165 --> 00:02:00.773
to TED Connects.

00:02:01.405 --> 00:02:02.684
Come on in, Seth.

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:06.757
Seth Berkley: Good
to see you there, Chris,

00:02:06.781 --> 00:02:10.319
and delighted to be with you
and all of the TED community.

00:02:11.981 --> 00:02:14.675
CA: Well, so look, on Tuesday,
Bill Gates was here,

00:02:14.699 --> 00:02:17.988
and he mentioned that
your organization, Gavi,

00:02:18.012 --> 00:02:23.255
is really at the heart
of the quest for a vaccine.

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:27.510
So tell us a bit -- what is Gavi?

00:02:29.316 --> 00:02:31.255
SB: So Chris, thank you for that.